              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CWE-125: Cursor lookahead read without remaining-bytes check"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Flags direct fixed-offset reads from a cursor-like pointer (e.g., cur[3]) in stream/parsing code when there is no nearby early-exit guard that checks the remaining bytes."
