              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CWE-416: Use-After-Free \u2014 lookup \u2192 remove \u2192 use (intra-procedural)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Flags flows where a pointer returned by a lookup (Lookup/Find/\u2026 patterns) is later used (deref/field/array/call/return) after a remove/erase/delete call in the same function."
              },
